      "id": "claim_dfe79f4974074de598381326bbc0b013",
      "statement": "Brijio's explicit non-goals (product boundaries, not missing features) are no cookie export, no session cloning, no browser mirroring/remote desktop, no continuous screenshots, no continuous DOM streaming, no background surveillance, no credential extraction, no MFA interception, and no browser history collection.",
